@@ -43,6 +43,8 @@
 ---
 
 ## OPERATING RULES
+
+- B4 patient chart reads omit Elation containment gates and pass the verified true-case token UID for an exact patient authUid check after the existing firebaseUid index lookup; leave shared containment and non-read callers unchanged because provisioning scope is independent of own-chart authorization.
 
 1. Do not ask for confirmation during execution unless blocked.
 2. Never use Firebase Auth displayName as the source of truth for user names. Always read from the Firestore users collection.

